      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying a heavy weight of guilt, and it's understandable that you are struggling with these thoughts. Please know that what you are experiencing is a sign of your deep capacity for empathy, even if it feels buried right now. Reaching out to a mental health professional can provide a safe space to explore these feelings and begin to process what happened. You do not have to carry this burden alone.",
